flowchart LR
  APP[SleepSense :app Central] --> DT[DeviceTransport]
  DT --> MOCK[MockDeviceTransport]
  DT --> GATT[AndroidGattDeviceTransport]
  GATT -. physical BLE not verified .-> VSB[VirtualSleepBand :virtualsleepband Peripheral]
  VSB --> HRS[Heart Rate 0x180D / 0x2A37]
  VSB --> BAS[Battery 0x180F / 0x2A19]
  VSB --> BSL[Body Sensor Location 0x2A38]
  VSB --> CUSTOM[Custom command + ACK characteristics]
